    "name": "세련된 원도 여행 경험 프로그램을 위한 랜딩 페이지 생성",
    "currentPage": "index.html",
    "ai": {
      "prompt": "Create a clean, modern one-page landing page for a local travel experience program in Wando, South Korea.\r\n\r\nConcept: “Sea & Refreshing”\r\nStyle: calm, airy, sophisticated, and natural. Inspired by the Wando sea and coastline.\r\n\r\nUse a white, soft sea-blue, muted teal, and deep navy color palette with generous whitespace and beautiful large photography.\r\n\r\nSections:\r\n1. Hero — “완도에서 만나는 하루”\r\n2. Introduction — “완도를 조금 더 가까이”\r\n3. Three experiences — NATURE / LOCAL / STAY\r\n4. Program information\r\n5. Final CTA — “완도에서의 시간이 궁금하다면”\r\n6. Footer\r\n\r\nMake it feel like a premium local travel/lifestyle brand, not a typical tourism or government website.\r\n\r\nKeep the page simple, visual, and easy to edit. The main CTA button should be suitable for linking to a Notion page.",
      "imageSearchQuery": "coast"
    },
    "theme": {
      "name": "startm5",
      "title": "StartM5",
      "styling": {
        "backgroundColor": "#F8FBFE",
        "primaryColor": "#006DAA",
