        {
          "_styles": {
            ".main_wrapper": {
              "position": "relative",
              "height": "(@heightMap * 100px)",
              "width": "100%"
            },
            ".b_wrapper": {
              "height": "100%",
              "display": "flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "position": "relative",
              "z-index": "2",
              "pointer-events": "none",
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                "position": "relative",
                "width": "100%",
                "height": "auto !important",
                "flex-direction": "column"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "margin": "0"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding": "0"
              }
            },
            "ul": {
              "list-style-type": "none",
              "padding": "0",
              "margin": "0"
            },
            ".item-wrapper": {
              "height": "100%",
              "background-color": "fade(@cardColor, @cardOpacity)",
              "pointer-events": "fill",
              "padding": "2.25rem",
              "@media (min-width: 992px) and (max-width: 1200px)": {
                "padding": "1.5rem"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                "width": "100%",
                "position": "relative",
                "padding": "2rem",
                "border-radius": "0px !important"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1rem"
              }
            },
            ".google-map": {
              "height": "100%",
              "width": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "left": "0",
              "top": "0",
              "z-index": "1",
              "iframe": {
                "height": "100%",
                "width": "100%",
                "border-radius": "0px !important"
              },
              "[data-state-details]": {
                "color": "#edefeb",
                "height": "1.5em",
                "margin-top": "-0.75em",
                "padding-left": "1.25rem",
                "padding-right": "1.25rem",
                "position": "absolute",
                "text-align": "center",
                "top": "50%",
                "width": "100%"
              },
              "&[data-state]": {
                "background": "#edefeb"
              },
              "&[data-state=\"loading\"]": {
                "[data-state-details]": {
                  "display": "none"
                }
              },
              "@media (max-width: 991px)": {
                "position": "static"
              }
            }
          },
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"contacts4 map1\" group=\"Contact\">\n\n\t<mbr-parameters>\n\t\t<input type=\"map\" title=\"Map\" name=\"googleMap\" value=\"<iframe src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m5!3m3!1m2!1s0x3572ef80bc4e39bd%3A0x8daec525751449de!2z7JmE64-E7ZW07JaR7LmY7Jyg7IS87YSw!5e0!3m2!1sko!2skr!4v1788961302438!5m2!1sko!2skr&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; height=&quot;450&quot; style=&quot;border:0;&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&quot;></iframe>\" place-id=\"<iframe src=&quot;https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m5!3m3!1m2!1s0x3572ef80bc4e39bd%3A0x8daec525751449de!2z7JmE64-E7ZW07JaR7LmY7Jyg7IS87YSw!5e0!3m2!1sko!2skr!4v1788961302438!5m2!1sko!2skr&quot; width=&quot;600&quot; height=&quot;450&quot; style=&quot;border:0;&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; referrerpolicy=&quot;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&quot;></iframe>\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Height Map\" name=\"heightMap\" min=\"8\" max=\"11\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"8\">\n\t\t<header>Show/Hide</header>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card\" name=\"showCard\" checked>\n\t\t<input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Card Title\" name=\"showCardTitle\" checked condition=\"showCard\">\n\t\t<input type=\"color\" title=\"Card BG color\" name=\"cardColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"showCard\">\n\t\t<input type=\"range\" inline title=\"BG card opacity\" name=\"cardOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"100\" step=\"1\" condition=\"showCard\">\n\t\t<select name=\"alignContent\" title=\"Align Content\" condition=\"showCard\">\n\t\t\t<option value=\"1\" selected>Left</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"2\">Center</option>\n\t\t\t<option value=\"3\">Right</option>\n\t\t</select>\n\t</mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"main_wrapper\">\n\t\t<div class=\"b_wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showCard\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container-fluid\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'justify-content-start' : alignContent == 1, \n                                            'justify-content-center' : alignContent == 2, \n                                            'justify-content-end' : alignContent == 3}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-5 col-lg-4 item-wrapper\">\n                        <h5 mbr-text class=\"cardTitle mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" data-app-selector=\".cardTitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showCardTitle\">\n                            <b>연락처 정보</b>\n                        </h5>\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\">\n                            </li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>프로그램 운영: 로컬바이로컬</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\">문의 전화:                                \n                            <a href=\"tel:+82 10-1234-5678\" class=\"text-black\">0</a>51-412-5855</li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\">영업 시간: 평일 10:00-18:00</li>\n\n                            <li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\">                        \n                            </li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b><br></b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\"><b>완도해양치유센터</b></li><li class=\"mbr-text item-wrap\">주소: 전라남도 완도군 신지면 내정2길 52-1</li>\n                        </ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n        <div class=\"google-map\" mbr-map=\"googleMap\">\n        </div>\n\t</div>\n</section>",
